  "title": "Cannot log in on mobile--unsecure connection",
  "content": "<p>When trying to log on using my admittedly old but up to date on software iPhone, I get the error “Safari can’t open the page because it couldn’t establish a secure connection to the server.” It used to work on this forum. For at least the last week it no longer does. I can browse but can’t log in as the error happens when I press the “Login” button on the top right.</p><p>Using Firefox I get the error “The owner of sso.st.com has configured their website improperly.”</p><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/16a0533c-4c73-4a9d-8965-fb6b57f46f2d.png\" /></figure><p> </p>",
